SUMMARY - COLLECT automated graphs possible (YES) ?

   YES - You can create scripts for automated Graphs .

1- if you run collgui using the debug ("-d") switch, it logs to STDOUT
the commands it uses to call "collect", filter with "cfilt", and
graph with "gnuplot".  If you start by cutting and pasting this
output, it's not hard to create scripts. (R Urban )

2- collgui -b will write out a script of whatever you do
manually in that collgui session.  You can then modify
this script as necessary for repeatability.  (B Skulley )

       Some script examples were also sent to get me going in the right
direction

