Hi,

Here is the belated summary.

Thanks to Rochelle Lauer, David J. DeWolfe, Russ Fish, Simon Millard, Tom
Ackenhusen, Tom Blinn, Randy Rogers, Alan Davis, Selden E Ball Jr, Bryan
Daniel, and anybody else who e-mailed me but I left off this list.

The answer is that the LMF supplied by MicroFocus Cobol is entirely
different from the LMF shipped with Tru64.  I needed to completely delete
three prior installations of MF Cobol's LMF and reinstall to get it to work.
I could do this safely without affecting the Tru64 LMF.  I'm still having
some issues with MFCobol's LMF but I'll work those out with their tech
support.

Thanks again everybody!
Andy


ORIGINAL QUESTION
