Thank everyone for the quick responses.  It is good to know that so many
people from HP Engineering read this list.  It is as I had suspected.  There
is no need to install PowerPath in 5.1A, and the frame is not configured
correctly.  In Tru64 5.x the Director bits need to be set differently.  And
my problem is caused by the "C" bit not being set.  Jan Mark Holzer sent a
whitepaper that he has written about this very topic. You can get it from
http://www.emc.com/techlib/abstract.jsp?id=1249

Thanks again..
Chris Ford

