Fellow Sysadmins,

We've been trying to chase down a couple of network/nfs problems in the =
last few weeks. The only tools/commands that we know of are "netstat", =
"tcpdump" and "nfsstat" as well as monitor & collect. We also got our =
Telecom guys involved because they have sniffers that can provide better =
breakdown of the network traffic through a particular NIC. We are trying =
to figure out the best way to tell what's coming through a NIC on a =
