Thanks to Premjit Nair for responding.  However it was HP/Compaq support
that provided the solution.  In the /etc/auth/system/default file the
u_newcrypt#2 was set.  This indicates which encryption algorithm to run.  I
changed this value to 0 and I can have a max of 80 for chosen password
length.

