Good Day Admin's,

Here's a paste from another list about the grep functionality in Linux.  Is
there a way to achieve this in Tru64UNIX?

START PASTE >>>>>>>
On Linux the grep has the next options:
OPTIONS
       -A NUM, --after-context=NUM
              Print NUM lines of trailing context after  matching
              lines.   Places  a  line containing -- between con-
              tiguous groups of matches.
       -B NUM, --before-context=NUM
              Print  NUM lines of leading context before matching
              lines.  Places a line containing  --  between  con-
              tiguous groups of matches.
       -C NUM, --context=NUM
              Print  NUM  lines of output context.  Places a line
              containing -- between contiguous groups of matches.
<<<<<<< END PASTE

Versions: 5.1 and 5.1A

Best Regards,

Blake Brehl
